WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.623
Frog: I can hop.

2
00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:22.940
Squirrel: I can hop too.

3
00:00:22.941 --> 00:00:30.668
Raccoon: Watch me hop!

4
00:00:30.669 --> 00:00:40.472
Turtle: I can't hop.

5
00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:51.127
Frog: I can hop over the log.

6
00:00:51.128 --> 00:01:01.269
Squirrel: I can hop over the log too.

7
00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:15.937
Raccoon: So can I!

8
00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:29.994
Frog: I can hop onto the rock.

9
00:01:29.995 --> 00:01:37.430
Squirrel: I can hop onto the rock too.

10
00:01:37.431 --> 00:01:47.571
Squirrel: Uh-oh. Ouch!

11
00:01:47.572 --> 00:01:50.943
Raccoon: Oof!

12
00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:55.951
Squirrel: I can't hop onto the rock.

13
00:01:55.952 --> 00:02:03.303
Raccoon: I can't hop onto the rock.

14
00:02:03.304 --> 00:02:08.679
Turtle: Hello.

15
00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.295
Frog: You hopped?

16
00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:25.863
Turtle: No, I walked.

